  "query_preview": "..\nA fairly dry and uneventful week is anticipated. Scattered island \neffect showers are expected to continue tomorrow afternoon for Guam \ndue to light easterly winds. This will keep showers mainly \nconcentrated to the west side near Agat. By Tuesday, gentle east \nwinds will be too high for island effect showers. However, brief \ntrade wind showers will be possible across the Marianas much of the \nforecast period as winds increase gradually from tomorrow. However, \nthese will remain weak and isolated to low-end scattered in nature.",
